[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0010","text":"大家～！\n演唱会玩得开心吗～！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0020","text":"呵呵～！太好了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0030","text":"我们会把气氛炒到最～嗨的～！\n大家也再放开一点，尽情喊出来吧～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0040","text":"咲耶，要上那个了哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0050","text":"呵呵，水花真漂亮\n观众们也很开心吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0060","text":"那当然！\n你看，大家那高兴的表情～！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0070","text":"恋钟—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0080","text":"喂摩美美……\n呀！好冷～！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0090","text":"呵呵\n大意失荆州"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400300_01_0100","text":"喂——！别跑～！！\n……跑得真快～！"}]
